---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Photo Release Form Template | usignpdf"
  seo={{
    page_description: "Download a free photo release form template to secure rights to images for your agency or freelance business.",
    canonical_url: "https://usignpdf.com/templates/photo-release/"
  }}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-20 px-4 md:px-8 prose max-w-none">
    <a href="/templates" class="text-accent no-underline hover:underline">&larr; Back to Templates</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Photo Release Form Template</h1>

    <p>If you run an <a href="/use-cases/agencies">agency</a> or work as a <a href="/use-cases/freelancers">freelance photographer</a>, you must secure the rights to use a model's likeness for commercial purposes. A photo release form handles this.</p>

    <div class="bg-surface-alt p-6 border border-border rounded my-8 flex justify-between items-center not-prose">
        <span class="font-bold">Standard Model & Photo Release (PDF)</span>
        <a href="#" class="px-4 py-2 bg-accent text-surface rounded hover:bg-accent-hover font-semibold">Download PDF</a>
    </div>

    <h2>On-Set Signing</h2>
    <p>Don't bring a clipboard to a photo shoot. Generate the release as a PDF, upload it to usignpdf, and have the model sign it directly on your phone or iPad using our <a href="/tools/signature-generator">Signature Generator</a>. It's fast, professional, and backed by a legally binding <a href="/security/audit-trails">Audit Trail</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
